---
source: crates/wows-query/tests/dispersion.rs
expression: output
---
ship:
  name: Des Moines
  index: PASC020
  tier: 10
  class: cruiser
  nation: USA
  group: upgradeable
  category: tech_tree
  status: released
battery: main_battery
range_km: 15
conclusion: "At 15 km, a 39.2% longer main battery range (15.83 km to 22.04 km with Spotting Aircraft + Gun Fire Control System Modification 2) shrinks vertical dispersion from 80.5 m to 73.2 m; horizontal is unchanged at 136.5 m. Aiming Systems Modification 1 narrows both: horizontal 136.5 m to 126.9 m, vertical 80.5 m to 74.8 m."
guns:
  - mount: main battery
    min_radius: 1.1
    ideal_radius: 8
    ideal_distance: 1000
    radius_on_zero: 0.2
    radius_on_delim: 0.5
    radius_on_max: 0.6
    delim: 0.5
builds:
  - build: base
    kind: base
    max_range_km: 15.83
    mounts:
      - mount: main battery
        at_range:
          ellipse:
            horizontal_m: 136.5
            vertical_m: 80.5
            vertical_ratio: 0.59
  - build: Spotting Aircraft
    kind: range
    max_range_km: 19
    max_range_change_pct: 20
    mounts:
      - mount: main battery
        at_range:
          ellipse:
            horizontal_m: 136.5
            vertical_m: 76.2
            vertical_ratio: 0.558
            horizontal_change_pct: 0
            vertical_change_pct: -5.4
  - build: Gun Fire Control System Modification 2
    kind: range
    max_range_km: 18.36
    max_range_change_pct: 16
    mounts:
      - mount: main battery
        at_range:
          ellipse:
            horizontal_m: 136.5
            vertical_m: 76.9
            vertical_ratio: 0.563
            horizontal_change_pct: 0
            vertical_change_pct: -4.4
  - build: Aiming Systems Modification 1
    kind: accuracy
    max_range_km: 15.83
    max_range_change_pct: 0
    mounts:
      - mount: main battery
        at_range:
          ellipse:
            horizontal_m: 126.9
            vertical_m: 74.8
            vertical_ratio: 0.59
            horizontal_change_pct: -7
            vertical_change_pct: -7
  - build: Outnumbered
    kind: accuracy
    condition: "Improves your ship's characteristics while the number of allies within your ship's main battery firing range doesn't exceed the number of visible enemy ships.\n\nYour ship is not counted as an allied ship."
    max_range_km: 15.83
    max_range_change_pct: 0
    mounts:
      - mount: main battery
        at_range:
          ellipse:
            horizontal_m: 122.9
            vertical_m: 72.4
            vertical_ratio: 0.59
            horizontal_change_pct: -10
            vertical_change_pct: -10
  - build: Spotting Aircraft + Gun Fire Control System Modification 2
    kind: range
    max_range_km: 22.04
    max_range_change_pct: 39.2
    mounts:
      - mount: main battery
        at_range:
          ellipse:
            horizontal_m: 136.5
            vertical_m: 73.2
            vertical_ratio: 0.536
            horizontal_change_pct: 0
            vertical_change_pct: -9.1
  - build: Spotting Aircraft + Gun Fire Control System Modification 2 + Aiming Systems Modification 1
    kind: range_and_accuracy
    max_range_km: 22.04
    max_range_change_pct: 39.2
    mounts:
      - mount: main battery
        at_range:
          ellipse:
            horizontal_m: 126.9
            vertical_m: 68.1
            vertical_ratio: 0.536
            horizontal_change_pct: -7
            vertical_change_pct: -15.4
notes:
  - "horizontal_m = 30 x (minRadius + X_m / 30 x (idealRadius - minRadius) / idealDistance), X_m the firing distance in meters and both radii times the accuracy coefficient (Aiming Systems Modification 1 and the like); it depends only on the firing distance. vertical_m = horizontal_m x vertical_ratio, where vertical_ratio runs linearly from radiusOnZero at 0 km to radiusOnDelim at delim x max range, then to radiusOnMax at max range. A longer max range lowers X / max range, so at the same X the ratio, and with it vertical dispersion, falls whenever radiusOnZero < radiusOnDelim < radiusOnMax. At max range horizontal_m is the port's maximum dispersion."
  - "max range is the modified main battery range: fire control module, upgrades, captain skills and Spotting Aircraft all lengthen it. The game client passes the modified range to the gun, and replay measurements (Colbert at 6 km, 13.8 km against 19.2 km range with range skill and upgrade) showed the predicted 16% smaller vertical spread. Spotting Aircraft lengthens the same range value, so it is assumed to act the same way; that case was not measured."
